.TH WREX-DOT11 7 "2026-10-18" "wrex 0.1.0" "wrex Manual"
.SH NAME
wrex-dot11 \- dot11 layer for \fBwrex\fR(1)

.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBwrex\fR \fIcraft\fR|\fIsend\fR [options] \fB--layer\fR \fIdot11\fR \fB--dot11\-<field>\fR=\fIVALUE\fR ...
\fBwrex\fR \fIfields\fR \fIdot11\fR

.SH DESCRIPTION
IEEE 802.11 MAC frame (LINKTYPE_IEEE802_11, no radiotap): frame control (version 2 bits, type, subtype, the to_ds..order flag aggregate), duration, addresses 1\-3 (+ address 4 under to_ds+from_ds), sequence (12\-bit seq + 4\-bit frag). A management body dissects into the elt record section (elt.0.ssid, elt.0.chan, …); control/data bodies stay payload. Management element crafting rides the payload verbatim (dissect\-only typing). Root layer (rank 10).
.

.SH ENCAPSULATION
Rank 10 (valid stack start: no parents).

.SH "FIELD FLAGS"
Dots in field paths become dashes in flags (ipv4.ttl -> --ipv4-ttl, --dot11-version).
Explicit values always win over autofill and are kept
unvalidated; \fB\-\-strict\fR re-validates (violations exit 2).
.TP
\fB\-\-dot11\-version=\fIINT\fR\fR
protocol version (2 bits; 0) Type u8. Default: 0.
.TP
\fB\-\-dot11\-type=\fIINT\fR\fR
frame type: mgmt|ctrl|data|ext or a bare 0\-3 number Type str. Default: mgmt.
.TP
\fB\-\-dot11\-subtype=\fIINT\fR\fR
frame subtype (4 bits; the management names: 8 = beacon, 4 = probe_req, …) Type u8. Default: 0.
.TP
\fB\-\-dot11\-flags\fR
frame\-control byte 1 bit aggregate: to_ds,from_ds,more_frag,retry,pwr_mgt,more_data,protected,order Type flagset. Default: 0.
.TP
\fB\-\-dot11\-duration=\fIINT\fR\fR
duration/ID (µs, or the PS\-Poll AID) Type u16. Default: 0.
.TP
\fB\-\-dot11\-addr1=\fIMAC\fR\fR
address 1 (receiver) Type mac. Default: 00:00:00:00:00:00.
.TP
\fB\-\-dot11\-addr2=\fIMAC\fR\fR
address 2 (transmitter) Type mac. Default: 00:00:00:00:00:00.
.TP
\fB\-\-dot11\-addr3=\fIMAC\fR\fR
address 3 (bssid/filter) Type mac. Default: 00:00:00:00:00:00.
.TP
\fB\-\-dot11\-seq=\fIINT\fR\fR
sequence control: 12\-bit sequence number + 4\-bit fragment (see frag) Type u16. Default: 0.
.TP
\fB\-\-dot11\-frag=\fIINT\fR\fR
fragment number (high 4 bits of the sequence word) Type u8. Default: 0.

.SH "RECORD SECTIONS"
Repeated record sections; dissected fields carry indexed paths (elt.0.field).

.TP
\fBelt\fR (dissect\-only)
management information\-element TLVs (dissect\-only; indexed paths elt.0.*, …). Control/data bodies stay payload.
  id (u8; default 0). element id (0 = ssid, 1 = rates, 3 = channel/ds)
  len (u8; default 0). element length (autofill: the value region)
  ssid (str; default ). typed view of a 0\-ssid element (the broadcast empty ssid is empty)
  chan (u8; default 0). typed view of a 3\-ds\-channel element (the first value byte)
  value (bytes; default ). raw element value bytes (the wire truth)

.SH EXAMPLES
wrex fields dot11

